3"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 109, "id": "64844802", "start": 104, "username": "a16z"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/CTs8fWVGok", "end": 133, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SoberLook/status/2119864157994659953/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119864106370965504", "start": 110, "url": "https://t.co/CTs8fWVGok"}]}, "id": "2119864157994659953", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 4463, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Unlike its Big Tech peers, Apple has avoided a comparable surge in AI infrastructure spending.\n\nSource: @a16z https://t.co/CTs8fWVGok", "url": "https://x.com/SoberLook/status/2119864157994659953"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-09T18:44:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119863666421997830"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/YRIIpQ79GI", "end": 276, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2119863666421997830/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119863366457925632", "start": 253, "url": "https://t.co/YRIIpQ79GI"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/YRIIpQ79GI", "end": 276, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2119863666421997830/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119863384246022144", "start": 253, "url": "https://t.co/YRIIpQ79GI"}]}, "id": "2119863666421997830", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 83, "impression_count": 20787, "like_count": 194, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 18}, "text": "THE AI BOOM HAS NEVER BEEN MORE FRAUGHT\n\nIn today's newsletter I wrote about the combo of the Jensen scandal, the Blue Tsunami, rapidly tightening financial conditions, and the big question of whether Zuck, Satya, and Sundar are truly AI-pilled or not. https://t.co/YRIIpQ79GI", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2119863666421997830"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-09T18:25:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119859044194422981"], "id": "2119859044194422981", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 35, "impression_count": 33362, "like_count": 465, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 62, "retweet_count": 24}, "text": "The whole thing is so strange. Doesn’t seem great for China to have one of America’s biggest advocates for chip diffusion and open source AI to get discredited.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2119859044194422981"}, {"author_id": "3039504459", "created_at": "2026-11-09T17:57:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119851905429971070"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Measurements on micrometer-scale cadmium samples provide definitive evidence of an unusual charge-transport regime in a 3D metal.", "display_url": "go.aps.org/4zesoCe", "end": 278, "expanded_url": "https://go.aps.org/4zesoCe", "images": [{"height": 200, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119851909301379072/EoIrEwEN?format=png&name=orig", "width": 200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119851909301379072/EoIrEwEN?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 255, "status": 200, "title": "Hydrodynamics of the Viscous Electron Fluid in Cadmium", "unwound_url": "https://journals.aps.org/prl/abstract/10.1103/g32f-j6q2", "url": "https://t.co/L4ZBVHgmS9"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/TCtHQMyhus", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2119851905429971070/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119851903127351296", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/TCtHQMyhus"}]}, "id": "2119851905429971070", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 784, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Researchers present the first definitive experimental fingerprint of a viscous electron fluid in 3D. Thanks to frequent electron-electron collisions, bulk cadmium’s conductivity scales with the square of both temperature and size in a specific window.\n\n🔗 https://t.co/L4ZBVHgmS9 https://t.co/TCtHQMyhus", "url": "https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2119851905429971070"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-09T17:48:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119849693526344115"], "id": "2119849693526344115", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 27, "impression_count": 35264, "like_count": 298, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 54, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "One question is. Whether in business or politics, has Jensen done anything different than just a pure revenue-maxing CEO would?", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2119849693526344115"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-09T17:36:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119846649094918274"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/shaunmmaguire/…", "end": 245, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/shaunmmaguire/status/2119582151985574371", "start": 222, "url": "https://t.co/uU4ajBDDK4"}]}, "id": "2119846649094918274", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 66, "impression_count": 45044, "like_count": 670, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 33, "retweet_count": 33}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119582151985574371", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Everyone in vc is rushing to defend Jensen. Liberal chip export rules mean competitive, near-frontier, inexpensive open models, meaning startups not having to pay the Ant Tax. I doubt it’s much more complicated than that. https://t.co/uU4ajBDDK4", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2119846649094918274"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-09T16:45:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119833668730626215"], "id": "2119833668730626215", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1797, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Two beliefs in tension with each other:\n\n1/ \"AI is a very powerful technology that will significantly transform the economy\"\n\n2/ \"AI's progress is extremely dependent on the specific identity of individuals running AI-affiliated companies\"", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2119833668730626215"}, {"author_id": "3512101",